///
/// # Formal specification
/// For all indices `i` in `0..k`, the final value at `i` equals the initial value at `k - 1 - i`.
/// For all indices `i` in `k..s.len()`, the final value at `i` equals the initial value at `i`.
///
/// # Preconditions
/// - `k` must be at least 2 and at most the length of `s`.
/// - The vector `s` must be non‑empty (implied by `k >= 2` and `k <= s.len()`).
///
/// # Postconditions
/// - The length of `s` is unchanged.
